# Supabase Edge Function secrets — configured via
#   `supabase secrets set --project-ref ktbhtglybkrahqaxhmrp NAME=value`
# or the Dashboard → Edge Functions → Secrets tab. These are read by the
# Deno runtime, NOT committed to git. Current state on remote:
#
#   BOT_TOKEN          ✅ set   (@BotFather token for tg-auth HMAC validation)
#   TG_BOT_TOKEN       ✅ set   (same bot; submit-purchase posts admin group notifications)
#   ADMIN_TG_IDS       ✅ set   (comma-separated Telegram numeric IDs auto-promoted to is_admin=true)
#   TG_ADMIN_CHAT_ID   ✅ set   (numeric chat_id of the admin Telegram group)
#   PUBLIC_ADMIN_URL   ✅ set   (https://biteporn.vercel.app — link in admin notifications)
#   SUPABASE_URL       🔒 auto
#   SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY 🔒 auto
#
# To rotate or inspect: `supabase secrets list --project-ref ktbhtglybkrahqaxhmrp`
# (values come back SHA-256 hashed for security — verify a candidate by hashing
# it locally with `echo -n "value" | sha256sum` and comparing.)